<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="selection-head"><text class="eyebrow">MY SELECTION</text><view class="section-title">我的选型单</view><view class="muted">记录喜欢的图册页、型号和款式，作为后续沟通依据。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!list.length}}" class="selection-empty">还没有记录。<br/>进入供应链目录，浏览图册后点击“记录这一页”。<button class="hero-link" bindtap="backHome"><text>去选产品</text><text>→</text></button></view>
  <view wx:else class="selection-list"><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="selection-item"><view><text class="selection-item-title">{{item.title}} · 第 {{item.page}} 页</text><text class="selection-item-meta">{{item.brand}} · 后续可补充具体型号或款式备注</text></view><button class="selection-remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view><button class="back-link" bindtap="clearAll">清空全部记录</button></view>
</view>
